# The X-ray pattern of a structure, written as a target for fix mad/xrd.
# A gamma-0 run 0 writes "x y_pred y_exp"; the reader takes the first two
# columns, so its output is itself a valid target. flat_target.dat is a
# placeholder on the same q range, needed only because target is required.
# Vars: data out
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       ${data}
pair_style      zero 9.5
pair_coeff      * *
neighbor        0.5 bin
compute         gr all mad/pdf r 0.1 8.0 301 kde 0.1
fix             xrd all mad/xrd c_gr target flat_target.dat q 1.0 8.0 281 &
                output qFq weighting xray species Li C O gamma 0.0 file ${out}
run 0
